{"id":"9189845d6da5bd4f","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-representability.md","title":"Representability Theorem","display":"thm-representability — Representability Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-representability","aliases":["57-thm-representability"],"display":"thm-representability — Representability Theorem","depends_on":["[[57-df-representable]]","[[57-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[57-df-recursive-function]]","[[57-df-hilbert-derivable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-representability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-representability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-representability — Representability Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4744f89052b0cbdb\" href=\"?note=4744f89052b0cbdb\" title=\"57-df-representable\">57-df-representable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cd1d3a421d8f589e\" href=\"?note=cd1d3a421d8f589e\" title=\"57-df-robinson-arithmetic\">57-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3cca93ccf127333f\" href=\"?note=3cca93ccf127333f\" title=\"57-df-recursive-function\">57-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"52897755c29c065c\" href=\"?note=52897755c29c065c\" title=\"57-df-hilbert-derivable\">57-df-hilbert-derivable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\ge1\">\\(k\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\">\\(R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_R\">\\(\\chi_R\\)</span> 是取值为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1\">\\(0,1\\)</span> 的总特征函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Recursive}(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Recursive}(R)\\)</span> 在本文件表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}(\\chi_R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}(\\chi_R)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3cca93ccf127333f\" href=\"?note=3cca93ccf127333f\" title=\"57-df-recursive-function\">57-df-recursive-function</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\">\\(\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\)</span> 互异；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"52897755c29c065c\" href=\"?note=52897755c29c065c\" title=\"57-df-hilbert-derivable\">57-df-hilbert-derivable</a> 的标准一阶关系。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Representable}(R,T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Representable}(R,T)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4744f89052b0cbdb\" href=\"?note=4744f89052b0cbdb\" title=\"57-df-representable\">57-df-representable</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_T(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_T(R)\\)</span> 的兼容写法；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"cd1d3a421d8f589e\" href=\"?note=cd1d3a421d8f589e\" title=\"57-df-robinson-arithmetic\">57-df-robinson-arithmetic</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Recursive}(R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Rec}(\\chi_R),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Representable}(R,T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Rep}_T(R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Recursive}(R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Rec}(\\chi_R),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Representable}(R,T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Rep}_T(R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Recursive}(R)\\to\\exists\\varphi_R\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\;\\left[\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi_R)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\}\\land\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\left(\n(\\vec n\\in R\\to Q\\vdash\\varphi_R[\\underline{\\vec n}/\\vec x])\\land\n(\\vec n\\notin R\\to Q\\vdash\\neg\\varphi_R[\\underline{\\vec n}/\\vec x])\\right)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Recursive}(R)\\to\\exists\\varphi_R\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\;\\left[\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi_R)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\}\\land\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\left(\n(\\vec n\\in R\\to Q\\vdash\\varphi_R[\\underline{\\vec n}/\\vec x])\\land\n(\\vec n\\notin R\\to Q\\vdash\\neg\\varphi_R[\\underline{\\vec n}/\\vec x])\\right)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Recursive}(R)\\to\\mathrm{Representable}(R,Q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Recursive}(R)\\to\\mathrm{Representable}(R,Q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-representable","status":"resolved","id":"4744f89052b0cbdb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-representable]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"cd1d3a421d8f589e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"3cca93ccf127333f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-hilbert-derivab